    Push submodule updates with the deploy key (#8177)
    
    The workflow prepares an SSH deploy key but then pushes through the
    HTTPS remote left behind by actions/checkout, which is authenticated
    with the workflow token. Commits pushed with that token never trigger
    workflows, so the daily submodule updates on develop and the release
    branches have not been getting a CI run.
    
    Push over SSH with the deploy key instead, which is what the key was set
    up for and what the Crowdin workflow already does.
    
